    "finalPromptText": "I'm writing a comparative literature essay on Flaubert's free indirect discourse in Madame Bovary.\n\n1. Find background on the novel and the realist movement.\n2. Summarize the structure (parts, arc, turning points).\n3. Describe the agricultural fair scene from Part II — how Flaubert intercuts Rodolphe's seduction with the prize speeches.\n4. Help me access or find the Part II Chapter 8 passage where the prize announcements interleave with Rodolphe's declarations — I have the Lydia Davis translation but left it in my dorm.",
