ony without authorial intrusion |\n| **Structure** | Three-part arc of desire → disappointment → destruction, with the fair scene as the central ironic set-piece of Part II |\n| **Agricultural Fair** | A cinematic montage of three discourses; civic, erotic, and interior clichés collapse into each other |\n| **Accessing the text** | Public domain via Gutenberg/Standard Ebooks; Davis translation via your library portal or digital purchase |\n\nGood luck with the essay! The agricultural fair scene is genuinely one of the richest passages in all of realist fiction for demonstrating how FID operates structurally, not just at the level of the individual sentence.",
